---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Base title="about" description="About sabfodel — physics undergraduate working on simulation and quantum computation.">
  <article class="sheet">
    <header class="entry-head">
      <span class="kicker">about</span>
      {/* TODO: Gerçek adını kullanmak istersen başlığı "Sabri …" gibi değiştir. */}
      <h1>Hi — I'm sabfodel.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin:0">
        Third-year physics undergraduate in Turkey. I understand things best once I've built
        them, so most of what I learn ends up as code.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What I work on</h2>
      <p>
        So far that has meant simulators written from first principles: light bending around a
        Schwarzschild black hole, a solar system integrated for a century, and a quantum circuit
        simulator that never builds a matrix it doesn't need. I care less about the pictures than
        about checking them — conservation laws, analytical limits and known results are how I
        decide whether code is telling the truth.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm moving toward <strong>quantum computation</strong>. I'm also exploring where
        computational and quantum physics meet <strong>biology and medicine</strong> — molecular
        simulation, medical physics, imaging. That part is early: I'm reading, not claiming.
      </p>

      <h2>Education &amp; training</h2>
      {/* TODO: üniversite adını ve beklenen mezuniyet yılını ekle. */}
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">BSc Physics</th><td>3rd year, in progress</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Qiskit Global Summer School</th><td>completed</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">QWorld · QBronze</th><td>in progress</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Tools</h2>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Languages</th><td>Rust, Python</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Quantum</th><td>Qiskit, own state-vector simulator</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Numerics</th><td>RK4 and friends, Monte Carlo sampling, Rayon parallelism</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Data</th><td>NumPy, pandas, scikit-learn, Matplotlib</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Writing</th><td>Markdown, LaTeX / KaTeX, Emacs org-mode</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Code lives on <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>.
        {SITE.linkedin && <> I'm also on <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.</>}
        {SITE.cv && <> A one-page <a href={SITE.cv}>CV</a> is here.</>}
      </p>

      <h2>Off the clock</h2>
      <p>
        I take photographs, read, and practise things that aren't physics. Those live in
        <a href="/photos/">photos</a>, <a href="/reading/">reading</a> and
        <a href="/journal/">journal</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
